{"h":3188,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.1023166019919988,"c":1,"h":0.014534883247863672,"w":0.11583011627197265,"y":0.042151163013772752},{"c":1,"t":"coordinates of the object - that is, its position - with a nearby AUV that carries superior","y":0.090025094002999406,"w":0.67567565917968753,"x":0.1023166104719804,"h":0.01607955743557532},{"w":0.5965251159667968,"t":"cameras, and arrange for that AUV to make a closer inspection of the object.","y":0.10602258454944491,"c":1,"x":0.10231659256215499,"h":0.014742785445420292},{"y":0.10610465127950441,"h":0.013081395042735311,"w":0.036679534912109402,"c":1,"x":0.83783783863038874,"t":"Q37"},{"c":1,"h":0.016114207402974756,"y":0.12923463007776936,"x":0.10231660771210936,"w":0.72007720947265619,"t":"Marine archaeologists are excited about the huge potential of these AUVs for their discipline."},{"t":"One site where they're going to be deployed is the Gulf of Baratti, off the Italian coast. In","h":0.017861630117878335,"w":0.68544016520182294,"x":0.10226655596681354,"y":0.14489668662186295,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10227795322850114,"y":0.16102232208298017,"t":"1974, a 2,000-year-old Roman vessel was discovered here, in 18 metres of water. When it","w":0.70472712198893239,"h":0.017475661250249686},{"x":0.10231661241849395,"y":0.17722710181907608,"t":"sank, it was carrying medical goods, in wooden or tin receptacles. Its cargo gives us insight","w":0.71042470296223958,"c":1,"h":0.016086851189396678},{"c":1,"x":0.102316625537235,"h":0.014742785445420292,"y":0.19322459228468192,"w":0.69884165445963542,"t":"into the treatments available all those years ago, including tablets that are thought to have"},{"c":1,"x":0.10231659695088899,"y":0.21075581418613532,"t":"been dissolved to form a cleansing liquid for the eyes.","h":0.014534883247863672,"w":0.42084943135579433},{"h":0.015997490589711449,"c":1,"y":0.23400250968617664,"t":"Other Roman ships went down nearby, taking their cargoes with them. Some held huge pots","x":0.10231660211180213,"w":0.71814671834309896},{"h":0.015997490589711338,"w":0.68918919881184892,"t":"made of terracotta. Some were used for transporting cargoes of olive oil, and others held","c":1,"x":0.1023165974173339,"y":0.24999999971927345},{"c":1,"h":0.017373178355218233,"t":"wine. In many cases it's only these containers that remain, while the wooden ships have been Q40","w":0.77229583740234364,"x":0.10227402857248392,"y":0.26591974660065598},{"y":0.28343023262298139,"h":0.011739152288496646,"t":"buried under silt on the seabed.","x":0.10424710876317396,"w":0.24710423787434899,"c":1},{"w":0.2548262532552083,"c":1,"x":0.10424710574047813,"y":0.31104651156293461,"h":0.013081395042735311,"t":"Another project that's about to ..."},{"t":"FIELTST","y":0.45071685649491511,"w":0.16108229319254563,"h":0.045722568947518027,"x":0.55837088628163689,"c":0.30000001192092896},{"t":"118","x":0.098455598605008326,"h":0.013081395042735311,"y":0.94622093034713439,"c":1,"w":0.034749034245808913}],"w":2400}